: "\"Fascinating\" means captivating."}, {"q": "He examined the broken chair carefully. Examined means …", "options": ["broke", "checked closely", "painted", "threw"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Examined\" means to inspect."}, {"q": "The crowd cheered when the team scored. Cheered means …", "options": ["clapped and shouted", "cried", "sat quietly", "walked away"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 0, "explain": "\"Cheered\" means loud support."}, {"q": "She avoided the busy road. Avoided means …", "options": ["crossed", "followed", "stayed away from", "used"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 2, "explain": "\"Avoided\" means to keep clear."}, {"q": "The teacher explained the lesson clearly. Explained means …", "options": ["asked", "made clear", "repeated", "wrote"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Explained\" means to clarify."}, {"q": "He collapsed after running a long distance. Collapsed means …", "options": ["fell down", "jumped", "rested", "stood up"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 0, "explain": "\"Collapsed\" means to drop suddenly."}, {"q": "The child was naughty in class. Naughty means …", "options": ["bad behaved", "helpful", "quiet", "smart"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 0, "explain": "\"Naughty\" means mischievous."}, {"q": "She donated money to the school. Donated means …", "options": ["borrowed", "gave freely", "kept", "took"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Donated\" means to give without cost."}, {"q": "The sky was cloudy all day. Cloudy means …", "options": ["bright", "clear", "covered with clouds", "sunny"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 2, "explain": "\"Cloudy\" describes the sky."}, {"q": "He invented a new machine. Invented means …", "options": ["broke", "created something new", "fixed", "used"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Invented\" means to make anew."}, {"q": "The baby crawled across the floor. Crawled means …", "options": ["jumped", "moved on hands and knees", "ran", "walked"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Crawled\" is slow movement."}, {"q": "She admired the beautiful painting. Admired means …", "options": ["disliked", "looked at with pleasure", "painted", "sold"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Admired\" means to appreciate."}, {"q": "The thief was captured by the police. Captured means …", "options": ["caught", "freed", "helped", "lost"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 0, "explain": "\"Captured\" means to seize."}, {"q": "He shivered in the cold wind. Shivered means …", "options": ["laughed", "shook with cold", "slept", "sweated"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Shivered\" is trembling from cold."}, {"q": "The book was complicated to understand. Complicated means …", "options": ["easy", "hard", "short", "simple"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Complicated\" means difficult."}, {"q": "She encouraged her friend to try again. Encouraged means …", "options": ["gave hope", "stopped", "told to give up", "warned"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 0, "explain": "\"Encouraged\" means to inspire."}, {"q": "The river overflowed during the rain. Overflowed means …", "options": ["dried up", "flowed over its banks", "froze", "stopped"], "topic": "Category 2: Vocabulary Meaning (50 Questions)", "answer": 1, "explain": "\"Overflowed\" means excess water."}, {"q": "He rejected the offer to join the team. Rejected means …", "options